Viktor 05.10.2026: «При долгой странице показывает старую трёхколоночную Кузню Творца, а затем только актуальный дизайн и
комнату. Можно ли прятать весь сырой рендер DOM, оверлеем `Loading the Sound Heresy`, логотип Студии крупно... и даже на
скором локальном соединении таймаут оверлея в 5 секунд?»

· the head script puts html.booting on before the first paint; the veil is the body's first element, over everything, in
  the theme's ground, the page under it not scrollable;
· the logo is the bar's own, copied into the veil right under the top bar (ids renamed, as the About card's copy) and
  copied again with the page's language by the translator; while the translation holds the page (i18n-wait) only the
  ground shows, so no English flashes before Russian;
· the words under it, letter-spaced, and a line that fills in five seconds;
· it lifts (a half-second fade) once the page is parsed with its scripts run, its room set and the translation in, and
  five seconds have passed since the navigation; a click or a key lifts it sooner once the page is ready; fifteen seconds
  lift it whatever happens; the readiness is not the load event, as the web fonts may come late on a slow road;
· never for a test browser (navigator.webdriver), ?scope=claude or ?noveil; ?veil brings it to one: the console test checks
  it covers the page as it boots and lifts after five seconds. The words in the six catalogs.
cdp-console 333/0/7, check-i18n 14/0, check-player 3/0.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
